  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">A sleek minimalist design, our Jade Drawstring Pouch is ready for plans day or night. Crafted of natural grain leather, the compact style has room for all the essentials and an interior organizational slip pocket. Finished with a cinched drawstring and magnetic snap closure, it can be worn crossbody or on the shoulder with the convertible strap.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Natural grain nappa leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Drawstring and magnetic snap closures</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside open pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Adjustable strap with 21.5&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
